TPM driver modifications for tests
==================================

This repository contains changes in the TPM driver in order to make some tests on a tpm_tis-spi and tpm_tis_i2c TPM:
- FIFO_BUFFER increased to 8kiB to overflow the FIFO
- Custom commands with the 0xFFFF tag and no additional data:
  - TPM_TCC_PWR_UP 0x0100 Power-up actions (re-activate interrupts and I2C CSUM)
  - TPM_TCC_LOCALITY_0 0x0200 Switch to locality 0
  - TPM_TCC_LOCALITY_1 0x0201 Switch to locality 1
  - TPM_TCC_LOCALITY_2 0x0202 Switch to locality 2
  - TPM_TCC_LOCALITY_3 0x0203 Switch to locality 3
  - TPM_TCC_LOCALITY_4 0x0204 Switch to locality 4
  - TPM_TCC_HASH_START 0x0300 Writes to TPM_HASH_START
  - TPM_TCC_HASH_DATA  0x0301 Writes command data to TPM_HASH_DATA (FIFO)
  - TPM_TCC_HASH_END   0x0302 Writes to TPM_HASH_END
- Timeout multiplicator, add 'sealsq,timeout-mult = <x>;' in the tpm0 section of the overlay file
  Useful when using the emulator, put 2 or 3 depending on the version.
  Default multiplicator is 2

Note: When powered-up, the I2C TPM uses the locality 0 instead of a previously selected one

Must be built with 'tpmtest' in the kernel release name, in order to be detected by the 
customized TCG proxy running executing the compliance tests

